  "identity": "V016 stereo refinement of the eight-note C-major syncopated call and answer. The brass signature stays centered for mono-TV readability; short bass accents sit left, while inner harmony and brief high FM crystal pings sit right. Rhythm, note contour, pauses, cue openings and the 180-frame NTSC loop remain from V015.",
